#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:39
#: 002393043a484ac4a7ebac0009415409 1eed92f0e3a74536a202f29f72766bc3
#: 66ac108872b145acb1628dd71dcec6a2 78a554fbfef249e0ab3d0e7cc6f3349d
#: 80ea2245ef5f4b619e09998ba1f4a96c d44e389000c342238533f2a75f62de91
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART7 (debug)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART7（调试）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:41
#: 2781528631a742dfbdc684ee4ebddff3 422c98b4ebbb40958c8a12cf05c671d8
#: 8f7e86e40bf54cd6823e94ccdc083c6b adbea3f3b97e43a8b85da267b6268828
#: bd58a208c84c4283b0d12f538513e9d4 c0989f2a102d44eb899f163b95f8015a
msgid ""
"The SERIAL1 port has RTS/CTS pins, the other UARTs do not have RTS/CTS."
msgstr "SERIAL1 端口有 RTS/CTS 引脚，其他 UART 没有 RTS/CTS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:43
#: 017aa5df33b14f7db959418540804d1c 1e06ed8739e644b8a1d7359c5a14d2cb
#: 253f9547dfbc4ac587f56e4fdfca4569 923b39a7957a4b16adc90c5ac5d7da24
#: c2b2703eb8e146b2aa9fd6a46d6a2a4b dc13421af4eb4f63b1232291c16023db
msgid ""
"The RCIN port can be used as RX or TX as a general UART using the "
"SERIAL4_OPTIONS bits to swap pins. It is not used for RC input (the PPM pin "
"is used for RC input)"
msgstr ""
"RCIN 端口可通过设置 SERIAL4_OPTIONS 位交换引脚，用作 RX 或 TX 通用 UART。它不用于 RC 输入（PPM 引脚用于 RC"
" 输入）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:47
#: 326cd5c8df8545288135c58a63eb9ec9 5e6acdd4e4ea4b618ba238e0f048d407
#: 6a0a184272df4d5cb68b19f09a81ee0c 8aa824063afb442f99925e7b61cd15ae
#: bb41276137314836a4309eed7c080d59 e60b13a5c59d40dba1be1735e052fb61
msgid ""
"The UART7 connector is inside the case and labelled as debug, but is "
"available as a general purpose UART with ArduPilot."
msgstr "UART7 连接器位于机壳内部，标记为调试，但在 ArduPilot 中可用作通用 UART。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:51
#: 0a34cecb622e4ccf878262f805b0aca4 459c957b57954fe0bed5b0986313dccb
#: 678d080aa1af421aa69e2ee421675f78 87325d3c5263413e92f048e8d4519574
#: 9414ef0e50544fa898d7662826f354c8 e9d25ab129e5409ea0fab22ddc387797
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:52
#: 2f6a58151bb24f24bce4d1f110c3553c 39aca83e347a46d78807cbd63c9ef5fa
#: a06ce1f51b9a45db99fd5271f2f422f6 a42a88cfe5c143c0bc1818c7f962c6e8
#: c89e1a17874744699c3e80271b5ba64b ef9a22730bb246e1b4ef75c331438e74
msgid ""
"The PPM pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"PPM 引脚默认映射到定时器输入，可用于除 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 之外的所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议（这两者需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，以这种方式连接时，FPort 只能提供 RC 而没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:54
#: 1b77ec71cfbe4696b6ed08ef38bca6b9 1ccfd4feed87411aac6899e78d6af51b
#: 8378ce80c29e430f9304e7169c456d97 8d2c327ebb21499f81be37a9509fbfe4
#: c29a2f9bb2e9464ea79a0d325665a661 f66038cd781e4ee0b24d8f37f4017807
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RCIN port's RCIN pin can also be configured to be used as "
"true UART RX or TX pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
"SERIAL4 parameters appropriately."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，RCIN 端口的 RCIN 引脚也可配置为真正的 UART RX 或 TX "
"引脚用于双向系统，方法是适当设置 SERIAL4 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:56
#: 18fe30931a504ce799989c31a0826ef3 6f55d337f77b4019971df8a1901954ac
#: b643c92107a04ab997f93a60cd5d21bd c7e01bb45a754edfb832a2e0f9055a38
#: e75e2239fd3a48c98771a87208dce582 fc990d677a0f4254912b783e6b91278d
msgid ""
"To use RCIN for bi-directional RC and Telemetry protocols, "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", and:"
msgstr ""
"要将 RCIN 用于双向 RC 和数传协议，:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 "
"「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:58
#: a220561b679a44a793eba9449227d033 aeda3dd62bd644b68f2245c93f5f42af
#: c29f4ff4d0d946e3887d72b7684d0de2 cea9e89e5bb243fa8227aaf8c02704b9
#: e7d42fac2bbd462c9ff732a174ffb862 fdf57b310b9f49238f8ea12156902a1b
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:60
#: 13f2354c634844c5b552690158fa3f3e 16547113a3864feaace577beb5ef3327
#: 57e436482a844ab6a26cb4bedc09123f aebc80172d384710bedf54c059a21a76
#: b884bdfd973e498aa6ed9a239c9a0f0d fa0c62f4c52746a793b1ae2474222835
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RCIN pin, but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\" to invert the "
"signal."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RCIN 引脚，但 SBUS 要求将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>`"
" 设置为 「3」 以反转信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:62
#: 0a3c473c81ff4b0fbd5a085f86b55b74 6ea79e1f9bcd4a7e8eb656fadc502415
#: 7087e9f8dfb449feb72a67647e298cbf aa00babf6e354536912b02f6b1781952
#: bab9fd25fc874515a242f8c765d09515 fdd7ca901565492fb268611f921d462b
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to RCIN and "
":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 RCIN，并将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:64
#: 3ee8f1d24b79493a80af3dbadc8ef558 8a2a31356bd84dee8a68a5ff78f961e2
#: 96a4bc7e62134ab59c8de2cd95c7ba95 99dc84cfba494eac94d5281478277f99
#: c62b7f0f466b47b1b46ed7d115e7f0cd cf49cbc07ef74688860ceedfe87497f6
msgid ""
"CRSF requires connection to both RX and TX of a UART, so the RCIN port and "
"pin cannot be used. Instead either SERIAL1 (UART2), SERIAL2 (UART4), or "
"SERIAL3 (UART1 must be used. Set its protocol to \"23\" and options to "
"\"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 需要连接 UART 的 RX 和 TX，因此不能使用 RCIN 端口和引脚。需使用 "
"SERIAL1（UART2）、SERIAL2（UART4）或 SERIAL3（UART1），将其协议设置为 「23」，选项设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:66
#: 009a605597bd45c2981c9093cf1d7f23 1e4cea2ecbe84a179e78ca87aacb3320
#: 80d2736e7c7a4cdd8446d86326524ac2 82e9b358860a4dac8782fd06f5dbdd1b
#: cb1a7eadde824cb48c1de48071a159f1 dc5a980444494b819449a5ddf401e062
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to RCIN and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 RCIN 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:68
#: 0003fb9e35f64d7fad0ee941b2b32d2c 1d776558a0774f7289a6699cc97a3dbc
#: 4aa3360d07ee4157a1d1a77c2eec56eb c8e367e9b9834175be5f8ba27416fd0e
#: ec40b07b0df3453985b8a801e53cd3d9 f9c00d31889c4b3fbc04d9657c54ee0e
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:71
#: 226c78acb576432a8c2f89d23a729497 29987d054b25472e93cd5f0bef9afb74
#: 6f5ff1996a934f5f93cdc33d22da23a6 9ff2239ca46c42808e025fd3f0523e8f
#: a449432bc6ff4fbea88799c4507fcbe7 f940135711a3416d9cf1261e2ab4e898
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:73
#: 0f23d1bb5bf24f60af43e46b62ab6171 101c262fe8914c12857b44543bbc59e2
#: 4077cd90f58b44d8b1b58556b7f41eb9 811bc919012146b6a82ce8c80abdb74f
#: d44d95e3b59b42fb9fe49aa05720064f e0f492cf659e4f6f9377d21698bc1ec6
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk4-Mini supports up to 11 PWM outputs. All 11 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All outputs except numbers 7 and 8 support DShot."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk4-Mini 最多支持 11 路 PWM 输出。所有 11 路输出均支持普通 PWM 输出格式。除第 7 和第 8 路外，所有输出均支持 "
"DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:77
#: 1fc9514a23864ec4a0b0d0e32702ee98 3335c89b9a474ef08f247c5d7f2c0bdd
#: ad67515e1b1d4165896ea634c4e42152 cc60b0363f40444f9f28cd04fb225def
#: e98d60092aa24c1c9f002168ca8474b4 f5f40dc8f03a432b8848954c827a54be
msgid ""
"The first 8 outputs are labelled \"MAIN OUT\" on the case. The next 3 "
